{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FUREA UERZT: Mars Code</strong> is a cinematic sci-fi racing adventure where speed decides the fate of worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a meteor strike threatens Earth, the race transforms into a mission of survival. As the last guardian racer, you\u2019ll harness futuristic vehicles, activate electromagnetic shields, and unlock quantum teleportation to stop planetary annihilation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race across alien terrains, from the chrome labyrinth of <strong>Chromium City</strong> to the dazzling rings of <strong>Ring City</strong>, each filled with unique challenges, enemies, and breathtaking sci-fi landscapes. Warp through wormholes, bend gravity, and master shifting tracks where every second demands courage and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715830/extras/7fa5ef811229435edfddddb753a2dd03.avif?t=1758083886\" width=576 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover hidden technologies, rewrite space-time, and prove that racing is more than sport\u2014it\u2019s the key to survival.\u00a0Prepare for the ultimate ride beyond imagination. Your FUREA UERZT adventure begins now. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715830/extras/26071b772c0d1675652a00fab3d92fd6.avif?t=1758083886\" width=576 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ring City</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the contrasting and beautiful city of <strong>Ring</strong>. The <strong>race</strong> has started. Face enemies from the <strong>future</strong>, use high speed. Discover! Then, become a winner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715830/extras/28f07010b20be8605099bc3d35f513ac.avif?t=1758083886\" width=576 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Future of Quantum Teleportation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The excitement of racing in the quantum energy <strong>generator</strong> area and activating the electromagnetic field as a shield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715830/extras/e0cba3641b966ddb09779b278c14f558.avif?t=1758083886\" width=576 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin Your FUREA Adventure today!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2715830?t=1758083886","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715830/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758083886","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715830/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758083886","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715830/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758083886","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FUREA UERZT: Mars Code</strong> is a cinematic sci-fi racing adventure where speed decides the fate of worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a meteor strike threatens Earth, the race transforms into a mission of survival. As the last guardian racer, you\u2019ll harness futuristic vehicles, activate electromagnetic shields, and unlock quantum teleportation to stop planetary annihilation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race across alien terrains, from the chrome labyrinth of <strong>Chromium City</strong> to the 